<title>FINLAND: DEN DANSKE NEW PRIMARY DEALER IN FINLAND BONDS.</title>
<headline>DEN DANSKE NEW PRIMARY DEALER IN FINLAND BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Treasury Office (STO) said in a statement on Friday that Danish banking group Den Danske Bank will become a primary dealer in Finnish government bonds from January 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Den Danske Bank is the tenth primary dealer in government bonds and the third foreign primary dealer, an STO official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The other foreign primary dealers are U.S. investment bank Goldman Sachs and Danish Unibank .</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
